          "author": "Nadia Shireen",
          "description": "Brought to you by Puffin.  \n\nThe next audio collection from Nadia Shireen features more of her best loved stories, including Barbara Throws A Wobbler, as well as Geoffrey Gets the Jitters. Presto visits the funfair to try out his conjuring skills, Rolf learns how to be a wolf, and Yeti makes a new friend.\n\nWith original sound design, this is a fun and heart warming listen.",
